{
  "matthew.20.p1.b1": {
    "text": "因为天国好像家主清早去雇人进他的葡萄园做工，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为天⁠国好⁠像家⁠主清⁠早去雇⁠人进他⁠的葡⁠萄⁠园做⁠工，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p1.b2": {
    "text": "和工人讲定一天一钱银子，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "和工⁠人讲定一⁠天一钱银⁠子，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p1.b3": {
    "text": "就打发他们进葡萄园去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就打⁠发他⁠们进葡⁠萄⁠园去。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p2.b1": {
    "text": "约在巳初出去，看见市上还有闲站的人，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠在巳初出⁠去，看⁠见市上还⁠有闲站的人，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p2.b2": {
    "text": "你们也进葡萄园去，所当给的，我必给你们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们也进葡⁠萄⁠园去，所当给的，我必给你⁠们。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p2.b3": {
    "text": "约在午正和申初又出去，也是这样行。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠在午正⁠和申初又出⁠去，也⁠是这⁠样行。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p3.b1": {
    "text": "约在酉初出去，看见还有人站在那里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠在酉初出⁠去，看⁠见还⁠有人站⁠在那⁠里，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p3.b2": {
    "text": "你们为什么整天在这里闲站呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们为⁠什⁠么整⁠天在这⁠里闲站呢？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p3.b3": {
    "text": "因为没有人雇我们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为没⁠有人雇我⁠们。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p3.b4": {
    "text": "你们也进葡萄园去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们也进葡⁠萄⁠园去。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p4.b1": {
    "text": "叫工人都来，给他们工钱，从后来的起，到先来的为止。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "叫工⁠人都来，给他⁠们工⁠钱，从后⁠来的起，到先来的为⁠止。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p4.b2": {
    "text": "约在酉初雇的人来了，各人得了一钱银子。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠在酉初雇的人来了，各⁠人得⁠了一钱银⁠子。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p4.b3": {
    "text": "及至那先雇的来了，他们以为必要多得；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "及⁠至那先雇的来了，他⁠们以⁠为必⁠要多⁠得；"
  },
  "matthew.20.p4.b4": {
    "text": "谁知也是各得一钱。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "谁知也⁠是各⁠得一钱。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p5.b1": {
    "text": "他们得了，就埋怨家主说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们得⁠了，就埋⁠怨家⁠主说："
  },
  "matthew.20.p5.b2": {
    "text": "我们整天劳苦受热，那后来的只做了一小时，你竟叫他们和我们一样吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们整⁠天劳⁠苦受⁠热，那后⁠来的只⁠做了⁠一小⁠时，你竟叫他⁠们和我⁠们一⁠样吗？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p5.b3": {
    "text": "朋友，我不亏负你，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "朋⁠友，我⁠不亏⁠负你，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p5.b4": {
    "text": "你与我讲定的不是一钱银子吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你与我讲定的不⁠是一钱银⁠子吗？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p6.b1": {
    "text": "拿你的走吧！我给那后来的和给你一样，这是我愿意的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拿你⁠的走吧！我给那后⁠来的和给你一⁠样，这是我⁠愿⁠意的。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p6.b2": {
    "text": "……因为我作好人，你就红了眼吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……因⁠为我作⁠好人，你就红⁠了眼吗？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p6.b3": {
    "text": "这样，那在后的，将要在前；在前的，将要在后了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠样，那在后的，将⁠要在前；在前的，将⁠要在后了。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p7.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣上耶路撒冷去的时候，在路上把十二个门徒带到一边，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣上耶⁠路撒⁠冷去的时⁠候，在路⁠上把十⁠二⁠个门⁠徒带⁠到一⁠边，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p7.b2": {
    "text": "看哪，我们上耶路撒冷去，人子要被交给祭司长和文士。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "看哪，我⁠们上耶⁠路撒⁠冷去，人⁠子要被交⁠给祭⁠司⁠长和文⁠士。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p7.b3": {
    "text": "……钉在十字架上；第三日他要复活。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……钉⁠在十⁠字⁠架上；第⁠三日他⁠要复⁠活。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p8.b1": {
    "text": "那时，西庇太儿子的母亲同她两个儿子上前来拜耶稣，求他一件事。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那⁠时，西⁠庇⁠太儿⁠子的母⁠亲同她两个儿⁠子上⁠前来拜耶⁠稣，求他一⁠件⁠事。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p8.b2": {
    "text": "你要什么呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠要什⁠么呢？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p8.b3": {
    "text": "愿你叫我这两个儿子在你国里，一个坐在你右边，一个坐在你左边。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "愿你叫我这两个儿⁠子在你国里，一⁠个坐⁠在你右⁠边，一⁠个坐⁠在你左⁠边。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p9.b1": {
    "text": "你们不知道所求的是什么；我将要喝的杯，你们能喝吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们不⁠知⁠道所求的⁠是什⁠么；我将要⁠喝的杯，你⁠们能喝吗？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p9.b2": {
    "text": "我们能。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们能。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p9.b3": {
    "text": "我所喝的杯，你们必要喝；只是坐在我的左右，不是我可以赐的，乃是我父为谁预备的，就赐给谁。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我所喝的杯，你⁠们必⁠要喝；只⁠是坐⁠在我⁠的左⁠右，不⁠是我可⁠以赐的，乃⁠是我父为谁预⁠备的，就赐⁠给谁。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p10.b1": {
    "text": "那十个门徒听见，就恼怒他们弟兄二人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那十个门⁠徒听⁠见，就恼⁠怒他⁠们弟⁠兄二⁠人。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p10.b2": {
    "text": "你们知道外邦人有君王为主治理他们，有大臣操权管束他们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们知⁠道外⁠邦⁠人有君⁠王为主治⁠理他⁠们，有大⁠臣操权管⁠束他⁠们。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p10.b3": {
    "text": "只是在你们中间，不可这样；……谁愿为首，就必作你们的仆人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:26-27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "只⁠是在你⁠们中⁠间，不⁠可这⁠样；……谁愿为⁠首，就必作你⁠们的仆⁠人。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p10.b4": {
    "text": "正如人子来，不是要受人的服事，乃是要服事人，并且要舍命，作多人的赎价。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正⁠如人⁠子来，不⁠是要受人⁠的服事，乃⁠是要服事人，并⁠且要舍⁠命，作多人⁠的赎价。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p11.b1": {
    "text": "他们出耶利哥的时候，有极多的人跟随他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们出耶⁠利⁠哥的时⁠候，有极多的人跟⁠随他。"
  },
  "matthew.20.p11.b2": {
    "text": "主啊，大卫的子孙，可怜我们吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，大⁠卫的子⁠孙，可⁠怜我⁠们吧！"
  },
  "matthew.20.p11.b3": {
    "text": "众人责备他们，不许他们作声；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人责⁠备他⁠们，不⁠许他⁠们作声；"
  },
  "matthew.20.p11.b4": {
    "text": "主啊，大卫的子孙，可怜我们吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，大⁠卫的子⁠孙，可⁠怜我⁠们吧！"
  },
  "matthew.20.p12.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣就站住，叫他们来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就站⁠住，叫他⁠们来，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p12.b2": {
    "text": "要我为你们做什么？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "要我为你⁠们做什⁠么？"
  },
  "matthew.20.p12.b3": {
    "text": "主啊，要我们的眼睛能看见！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，要我⁠们的眼⁠睛能看⁠见！"
  },
  "matthew.20.p13.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣就动了慈心，把他们的眼睛一摸，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就动⁠了慈⁠心，把他⁠们的眼⁠睛一⁠摸，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p13.b2": {
    "text": "他们立刻看见，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们立⁠刻看⁠见，"
  },
  "matthew.20.p13.b3": {
    "text": "就跟从了耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 20:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就跟从了耶⁠稣。"
  }
}
